message: "If you use this task, please cite it as below."
title: "Congo peat pollen: a research-grade AI evaluation task in palaeoecology"
abstract: "A Harbor-format evaluation task in which an AI agent calibrates radiocarbon dates, screens contaminated samples, builds an age-depth model and reconstructs pollen influx for a Congo Basin peat core. Includes a reference solution, hardened verifier and grader-validation harness."
authors:
